    "adapt": "An industrial compound on open gravel: the concrete plant is the host (no entrance, so the kit keeps the plant's own yaw, +z east). Three groups, all on the ground (terrain rows, run town fit --terrain): the recycler bench on the apron 20 m east of the plant, the dealer's yard round the site cabin on its north side, the dump (wrecks, tyres, searchable scrap piles) on the open plot north-east. Rows are rigid: shift, never stretch."
